#: ../../../news_pool.rst:16
msgid ""
"Invoke the `!reconnect_failed` callback in `NullConnectionPool`, where it "
"was accepted but never called (:ticket:`#1424`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../news_pool.rst:18
msgid ""
"Fix the count of the connections in `NullConnectionPool` becoming negative "
"after a failed `~NullConnectionPool.wait()`."
msgstr ""

